1
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:35,030
[Forging Justice]

2
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:37,620
[Episode 22]

3
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:42,870
If I were a judge,

4
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,870
I might acquit him.

5
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:47,550
But I am a prosecutor now,

6
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,650
and my job is to fight crime.

7
00:01:51,710 --> 00:01:53,640
From a prosecutor's perspective,

8
00:01:54,070 --> 00:01:54,950
I don't think

9
00:01:54,950 --> 00:01:55,509
we can rule out the possibility

10
00:01:55,509 --> 00:01:57,110
that he committed the crime.

11
00:01:57,890 --> 00:01:58,640
That is also the view

12
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:01,100
held by my colleagues
at the procuratorate.

13
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,860
Different positions can lead

14
00:02:05,350 --> 00:02:06,590
to completely different views

15
00:02:06,590 --> 00:02:07,650
on the same matter.

16
00:02:12,590 --> 00:02:14,190
You don't like hearing this?

17
00:02:18,770 --> 00:02:19,650
If staying here

18
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,590
is of no use,

19
00:02:21,030 --> 00:02:22,030
are you planning

20
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,120
to head back home?

21
00:02:23,590 --> 00:02:24,990
What, Prosecutor Zheng?

22
00:02:25,190 --> 00:02:26,400
Are you hoping

23
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,400
we'll leave soon?

24
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:30,190
They might be.

25
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,400
I'm not.

26
00:02:33,430 --> 00:02:34,240
I even hope

27
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:36,300
you'll stay right here and not leave.

28
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,329
This chili is way too spicy.

29
00:02:40,310 --> 00:02:41,640
Did you get choked by it?

30
00:02:42,150 --> 00:02:43,680
Can you get used to the food?

31
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,400
Why is it so spicy?

32
00:02:45,750 --> 00:02:47,750
Have a piece of beef. It's not spicy.

33
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,150
Xia.

34
00:02:52,190 --> 00:02:53,440
Yin Ping's death

35
00:02:53,710 --> 00:02:54,710
is not your fault.

36
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,960
Don't carry that weight on yourself.

37
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,020
This is a clear case

38
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,870
of intentional homicide.

39
00:03:00,870 --> 00:03:02,910
The perpetrator set out to take his life.

40
00:03:02,910 --> 00:03:04,040
It wasn't for money,

41
00:03:04,710 --> 00:03:06,430
and it definitely
wasn't a crime of passion.

42
00:03:06,430 --> 00:03:08,840
It was most likely a revenge killing.

43
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:11,630
Given Yin Ping's situation,

44
00:03:11,750 --> 00:03:12,880
he could be annoying

45
00:03:13,310 --> 00:03:14,360
at times,

46
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,120
but who would hold

47
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,850
such a deep grudge against him?

48
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,010
Don't worry.

49
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,960
The case will be solved soon.

50
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,630
How can you be so sure?

51
00:03:24,190 --> 00:03:25,710
Within dozens of miles around,

52
00:03:25,710 --> 00:03:26,510
there are only

53
00:03:26,870 --> 00:03:28,470
about 2,000 people across 3 villages.

54
00:03:28,470 --> 00:03:30,120
Yin Ping never left the village.

55
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:32,000
How could he have offended outsiders?

56
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:32,530
Besides,

57
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,910
this place is not on any major

58
00:03:33,910 --> 00:03:34,910
transport route.

59
00:03:35,079 --> 00:03:37,470
The chance
of a drifter committing the crime

60
00:03:37,470 --> 00:03:38,630
is extremely low.

61
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:41,800
So you mean

62
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,760
someone from the village did it?

63
00:04:00,630 --> 00:04:01,030
Hu.

64
00:04:01,750 --> 00:04:02,710
Where is Xudong?

65
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:05,030
He went to town early this morning
to buy things.

66
00:04:05,030 --> 00:04:06,190
He's getting married, isn't he?

67
00:04:06,190 --> 00:04:07,720
You need him for something?

68
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:08,470
No, nothing.

69
00:04:08,470 --> 00:04:09,150
Nothing.

70
00:04:09,190 --> 00:04:09,680
Hu.

71
00:04:10,870 --> 00:04:11,910
I heard someone was killed.

72
00:04:11,910 --> 00:04:12,780
It was Yin Ping?

73
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:14,710
Did he kill someone,
or did someone kill him?

74
00:04:14,710 --> 00:04:15,310
What's up?

75
00:04:16,019 --> 00:04:17,240
You got something to report?

76
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:17,769
Perfect.

77
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:20,089
Judge Xia is here. Speak your mind.

78
00:04:21,269 --> 00:04:23,920
Me? What do I know? I...

79
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:33,020
Why did the power suddenly go out?

80
00:04:33,270 --> 00:04:33,830
Mentor!

81
00:04:34,870 --> 00:04:35,600
You're back.

82
00:04:36,190 --> 00:04:36,800
Lihui.

83
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,070
Lihui.

84
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:43,360
Let's go to Yan Jicai's place

85
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,220
and take a look.

86
00:04:44,270 --> 00:04:45,600
Did you get the address?

87
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,920
I know which street it's probably on.

88
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,159
We'll locate the exact place
once we arrive.

89
00:04:49,159 --> 00:04:50,020
Before we came,

90
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,680
we should have asked Yan Jicai.

91
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,610
We can't do that.

92
00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:54,530
Nothing's certain yet.

93
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,290
We must not give him false hope.

94
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,120
No. 3 You'ai Lane.

95
00:04:58,190 --> 00:04:59,240
Caiji Noodle House.

96
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,170
His wife runs it.

97
00:05:00,510 --> 00:05:01,390
How did you know

98
00:05:01,430 --> 00:05:03,360
we were going to Yan Jicai's place?

99
00:05:03,430 --> 00:05:04,490
I took a few days off

100
00:05:04,750 --> 00:05:05,720
to be your local guide.

101
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,720
Let me come along.

102
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:09,560
He's quite thoughtful, isn't he?

103
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,320
Keep your voice down.

104
00:05:20,950 --> 00:05:21,950
This is the biggest urban village

105
00:05:21,950 --> 00:05:23,040
in Nanlu City.

106
00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:24,480
They've been saying they'll renovate it,

107
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,610
but no one knows when that will happen.

108
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,520
This is it.

109
00:05:34,630 --> 00:05:35,040
Hello.

110
00:05:36,310 --> 00:05:37,310
Are you Liu Guiya?

111
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,010
Yes, I am.

112
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,480
And you are...

113
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:45,120
I'm from the municipal procuratorate.

114
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:45,720
These two are

115
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:46,920
from Bieshan Prison.

116
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,970
Did something happen to Jicai?

117
00:05:54,750 --> 00:05:55,880
Did he kill himself?

118
00:05:55,950 --> 00:05:56,430
No.

119
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,000
He is perfectly fine.

120
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,060
Okay...

121
00:06:01,510 --> 00:06:01,970
Okay...

122
00:06:02,830 --> 00:06:04,480
Before he was taken away,

123
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,360
did he mention to you

124
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:07,290
that he picked up a girl that night?

125
00:06:07,310 --> 00:06:07,840
No.

126
00:06:08,110 --> 00:06:08,600
No?

127
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,560
He picked up so many passengers every day.

128
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,310
He wouldn't tell me
about every single one.

129
00:06:12,310 --> 00:06:14,040
That passenger was different.

130
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,920
He picked her up

131
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:16,950
in the middle of the night,

132
00:06:16,950 --> 00:06:18,390
drove her around for more than an hour,

133
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:20,520
and didn't charge her a cent in the end.

134
00:06:21,270 --> 00:06:23,000
I only found out about it later.

135
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:25,720
He had his lawyer tell me the following.

136
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,510
That girl was pretty.

137
00:06:28,390 --> 00:06:29,830
She kept crying
as soon as she got in the car.

138
00:06:29,830 --> 00:06:30,960
She looked pitiful.

139
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:34,360
He had a bit of a soft spot for her,

140
00:06:35,630 --> 00:06:37,390
so he acted on impulse
and waived the fare.

141
00:06:37,390 --> 00:06:38,190
Men, you know,

142
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,330
can be like that sometimes,

143
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,320
swept away by foolish whims.

144
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,120
I can understand.

145
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,640
You two have a good marriage.

146
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,070
Normally,

147
00:06:51,750 --> 00:06:53,480
he wouldn't tell you the truth,

148
00:06:53,830 --> 00:06:54,310
right?

149
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,240
What man would willingly

150
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:58,500
confess something like that to his wife?

151
00:06:59,390 --> 00:07:01,310
So I thought it was perfectly normal

152
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:03,040
that he didn't tell me at first.

153
00:07:06,830 --> 00:07:08,230
Besides, I have evidence

154
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:11,390
that proves he couldn't have done that.

155
00:07:13,270 --> 00:07:14,530
Wait here for a moment.

156
00:07:19,270 --> 00:07:20,160
Don't you think

157
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,300
she's impressive?

158
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:29,760
Is it good?

159
00:07:32,270 --> 00:07:33,000
Pretty good.

160
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,659
What did the police ask you today?

161
00:07:42,950 --> 00:07:44,350
Let me ask you a question.

162
00:07:48,390 --> 00:07:49,480
Do you think

163
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,950
I'm a troublemaker?

164
00:07:56,270 --> 00:07:57,530
Don't think like that.

165
00:07:57,870 --> 00:07:59,000
You didn't kill him.

166
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,980
What does this have to do with you?

167
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,750
At least his death

168
00:08:04,070 --> 00:08:05,600
has something to do with me.

169
00:08:08,310 --> 00:08:09,430
I don't know. I...

170
00:08:09,950 --> 00:08:11,190
Why I...

171
00:08:12,740 --> 00:08:13,890
I don't know

172
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:15,160
what I should do.

173
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,500
I'll stay here with you for a few days.

174
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,260
There's...

175
00:08:43,549 --> 00:08:44,880
no place for you to stay.

176
00:08:45,030 --> 00:08:46,750
There's no guesthouse here.

177
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,900
It's fine. I'll go to town.

178
00:08:50,670 --> 00:08:51,360
But

179
00:08:51,670 --> 00:08:53,390
it's not convenient for you to come here

180
00:08:53,390 --> 00:08:54,360
from town.

181
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,410
Going back and forth...

182
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:02,840
You can just

183
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:04,330
stay here tonight.

184
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:06,440
You're so considerate of me?

185
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:09,200
You can sleep on the floor or something.

186
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,480
If I stay here,

187
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:13,660
aren't you worried
about gossip in the village?

188
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,440
Things are already like this.

189
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:18,370
Who cares about what others think?

190
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,670
Exactly. Things are already like this.

191
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:22,130
Why do you care about them?

192
00:09:22,910 --> 00:09:24,640
This has nothing to do with you.

193
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,000
Did you get flour on your face

194
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,660
when you were making noodles?

195
00:09:32,510 --> 00:09:33,970
Why are there two streaks?

196
00:09:42,670 --> 00:09:43,270
All right.

197
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:46,680
Don't torment yourself like this.

198
00:09:47,180 --> 00:09:49,720
[Got a passenger]

199
00:09:56,750 --> 00:09:58,480
Ever since he got into trouble,

200
00:09:58,550 --> 00:09:59,270
I take it out

201
00:09:59,270 --> 00:10:00,320
every now and then to look at it,

202
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,980
afraid it might stop working.

203
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:05,510
Look,

204
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,120
if he really had committed the crime

205
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,030
at that time,

206
00:10:08,750 --> 00:10:09,750
how would he have had time

207
00:10:09,750 --> 00:10:10,960
to find a payphone

208
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,390
and page me?

209
00:10:13,030 --> 00:10:13,510
You didn't

210
00:10:13,510 --> 00:10:15,030
hand this over to the police at the time?

211
00:10:15,030 --> 00:10:15,510
I did.

212
00:10:16,870 --> 00:10:18,470
A young police officer came,

213
00:10:18,870 --> 00:10:20,070
and I showed it to him.

214
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:20,910
And then?

215
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:22,550
He looked at it,

216
00:10:23,630 --> 00:10:24,440
said it had nothing to do with the case,

217
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:25,630
and gave it back to me.

218
00:10:25,630 --> 00:10:26,790
When was that?

219
00:10:27,630 --> 00:10:30,000
After the procuratorate
approved the arrest.

220
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:32,460
They filed the prosecution
a few days later.

221
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,860
I have another piece of evidence.

222
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:44,910
Those two days,

223
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,650
Jicai wore the same jacket.

224
00:10:47,150 --> 00:10:48,000
He didn't change it

225
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,260
until he was arrested.

226
00:10:50,150 --> 00:10:51,350
But there was no blood

227
00:10:51,550 --> 00:10:52,770
on that jacket at all.

228
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:55,100
That girl was strangled to death.

229
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:55,670
Comrade!

230
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,270
You're convinced that Jicai

231
00:10:58,270 --> 00:10:59,070
is the killer,

232
00:11:00,870 --> 00:11:01,530
aren't you?

233
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,260
Prosecutor Zheng,

234
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:18,160
what's your take now?

235
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:19,580
Mr. Guo,

236
00:11:19,870 --> 00:11:21,670
you can call me Zheng or Jianmin.

237
00:11:23,150 --> 00:11:24,080
To be honest,

238
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:26,080
there are indeed some doubts,

239
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:28,080
but they're not compelling enough.

240
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,530
What makes you say that?

241
00:11:31,260 --> 00:11:32,200
Even if we exclude

242
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:34,060
the time he spent paging his wife,

243
00:11:34,530 --> 00:11:35,390
theoretically he still

244
00:11:35,390 --> 00:11:37,390
had enough time to commit the crime.

245
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:39,840
What else?

246
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:41,080
The bloodstains.

247
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,030
If Yan Jicai

248
00:11:43,030 --> 00:11:44,690
was a premeditated predator,

249
00:11:45,030 --> 00:11:45,890
he could easily

250
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,320
have prepared a set of clothes in advance

251
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,360
and kept them in the car

252
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,870
specifically for the crime.

253
00:11:49,870 --> 00:11:50,720
You think

254
00:11:51,630 --> 00:11:53,230
he's a psychopathic killer?

255
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:55,320
The killer murdered the victim,
then desecrated her corpse,

256
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,360
and stuffed a wine bottle

257
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,720
into the victim's genitals.

258
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:59,450
This is not an ordinary rapist.

259
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,270
He's likely got

260
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:04,120
some kind of psychological
or physiological defect.

261
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:04,870
And I don't think

262
00:12:04,870 --> 00:12:06,470
it was an impulsive killing.

263
00:12:07,670 --> 00:12:09,800
He might have planned it for a long time

264
00:12:10,670 --> 00:12:12,130
and even practiced for it.

265
00:12:12,510 --> 00:12:13,150
Emotionally,

266
00:12:13,150 --> 00:12:15,150
I'd really like to believe his wife.

267
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:17,270
But as a prosecutor, I can't let that

268
00:12:17,270 --> 00:12:18,240
cloud my judgment.

269
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:18,720
Right.

270
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,320
People say what they choose to say

271
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,630
and remember what they choose to remember.

272
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:22,360
What's more,

273
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:25,140
they have such a close relationship.

274
00:12:28,450 --> 00:12:29,320
Mr. Guo, do you think

275
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:29,980
I'm a bit...

276
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,120
No, no, no.

277
00:12:31,630 --> 00:12:32,360
You're fine.

278
00:12:33,630 --> 00:12:34,360
You're fine.

279
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:49,720
Can I ask you

280
00:12:49,750 --> 00:12:50,840
one last question?

281
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:52,080
Of course,

282
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,840
you can choose not to answer.

283
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:54,790
Sure.

284
00:12:57,270 --> 00:12:58,530
I'll answer anything.

285
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:02,280
When was the last time

286
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:04,320
you and Yan Jicai

287
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,240
were intimate?

288
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:09,240
Two days before he was arrested.

289
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:10,890
I remember it very clearly,

290
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:13,790
because we had been discussing

291
00:13:13,790 --> 00:13:15,050
having a second child.

292
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:17,790
We'd even set aside the money

293
00:13:17,790 --> 00:13:19,450
for the family planning fine.

294
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:22,640
Then was it...

295
00:13:23,910 --> 00:13:24,510
good?

296
00:13:28,670 --> 00:13:29,720
I mean...

297
00:13:31,150 --> 00:13:32,320
How did he perform?

298
00:13:36,270 --> 00:13:37,030
He was good.

299
00:13:37,270 --> 00:13:38,330
He was really good.

300
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:41,080
Really.

301
00:13:41,670 --> 00:13:42,870
Everything was good.

302
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:50,840
Thank you

303
00:13:51,670 --> 00:13:52,360
for providing us

304
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:53,820
with so much information.

305
00:13:57,630 --> 00:13:58,790
You are a good wife.

306
00:13:59,390 --> 00:14:00,630
Yan Jicai is lucky

307
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,270
to have you.

308
00:14:10,510 --> 00:14:11,480
Thank you.

309
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:14,350
Thank you for coming all this way

310
00:14:14,780 --> 00:14:16,240
to investigate this case.

311
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:18,840
No matter what the outcome is,

312
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:21,300
you'll always be our family's benefactors.

313
00:14:29,150 --> 00:14:29,670
Lihui.

314
00:14:32,470 --> 00:14:33,150
Mentor.

315
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:36,450
Where are we going next?

316
00:14:40,670 --> 00:14:41,530
Zheng Jianmin.

317
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:43,390
Do you still think

318
00:14:43,390 --> 00:14:44,720
Yan Jicai is the killer?

319
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:47,420
I was just discussing it with Mr. Guo.

320
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:49,270
I don't think we can rule him out yet.

321
00:14:49,270 --> 00:14:51,670
So you expect him
to prove his own innocence

322
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:53,180
while locked up in prison?

323
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,040
A person needs

324
00:14:54,050 --> 00:14:55,290
to collect evidence for something

325
00:14:55,290 --> 00:14:56,020
he never did.

326
00:14:56,150 --> 00:14:57,630
Don't you find that absurd?

327
00:14:57,630 --> 00:14:58,150
Lihui,

328
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:00,750
Jianmin has a point.

329
00:15:01,510 --> 00:15:02,960
We can't let our emotions

330
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:04,090
cloud our judgment.

331
00:15:04,550 --> 00:15:06,240
So what did his wife tell you?

332
00:15:09,670 --> 00:15:10,550
His wife said

333
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:13,100
their intimate life was good,

334
00:15:13,340 --> 00:15:14,080
and that they were planning

335
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:15,340
to have a second child.

336
00:15:15,450 --> 00:15:16,270
I don't believe

337
00:15:16,270 --> 00:15:17,120
that someone who has long-term plans

338
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:18,150
for the future

339
00:15:18,170 --> 00:15:19,770
and values his family deeply

340
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:22,280
could be a psychopathic killer.

341
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:23,200
I also don't believe

342
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,360
that a psychopathic killer

343
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:25,080
could marry

344
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:25,840
such a good woman.

345
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:26,600
Lihui.

346
00:15:27,550 --> 00:15:29,010
I understand how you feel.

347
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:30,930
But what you're feeling

348
00:15:31,030 --> 00:15:33,290
isn't evidence that the law recognizes.

349
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:37,670
Mentor.

350
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:40,960
I can understand

351
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:42,220
her fear, loneliness,

352
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,060
grievance and fear

353
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:45,440
as a woman.

354
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:47,720
You men cannot possibly

355
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,080
relate to that,

356
00:15:49,550 --> 00:15:50,840
just like you can't understand

357
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:51,750
why she's been able to remain

358
00:15:51,750 --> 00:15:53,280
so resilient all this time!

359
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:56,840
Yes.

360
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:59,780
I let my emotions get the better of me.

361
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:02,940
I'll take a walk by myself.

362
00:16:04,390 --> 00:16:04,910
Lihui.

363
00:16:04,930 --> 00:16:05,810
Don't. Don't.

364
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:11,240
It's the first time
I've seen her like this.

365
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:12,620
Don't take it to heart.

366
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:15,010
I won't, Mr. Guo.

367
00:16:16,510 --> 00:16:17,360
I actually quite like

368
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,290
this side of her.

369
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:22,390
She's no longer

370
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:24,150
that overly cautious

371
00:16:24,150 --> 00:16:25,610
college girl she once was.

372
00:16:28,030 --> 00:16:29,480
That explains it.

373
00:16:32,320 --> 00:16:33,450
But as a prosecutor,

374
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:36,000
she still lacks experience.

375
00:16:36,550 --> 00:16:38,360
Y-You need to help her

376
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:39,480
in the future.

377
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:46,960
So next,

378
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:47,670
should we go

379
00:16:47,690 --> 00:16:49,690
to the victim's boyfriend's place?

380
00:16:52,270 --> 00:16:53,630
Not bad, young man.

381
00:16:53,670 --> 00:16:54,870
Wait, how did you know

382
00:16:54,890 --> 00:16:56,150
what we were thinking?

383
00:16:57,030 --> 00:16:58,320
His name is Qiao Xiaojun.

384
00:16:58,320 --> 00:16:59,480
He lives at Room 301,

385
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:01,720
Block 2, Building 6, No.12 Shengli Street.

386
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:03,390
He's already married with kids,

387
00:17:03,390 --> 00:17:04,200
so it might be

388
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:05,859
a bit difficult to talk to him.

389
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:08,750
I don't think we have enough time today.

390
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:10,280
How about we go another day?

391
00:17:10,790 --> 00:17:11,510
Sure.

392
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,069
Lihui.

393
00:17:15,790 --> 00:17:16,640
Zhang Lihui!

394
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:18,200
Wait, wait.

395
00:17:19,200 --> 00:17:20,530
You're walking so fast.

396
00:17:20,589 --> 00:17:21,650
I'm sorry, Mentor.

397
00:17:22,829 --> 00:17:24,829
What? What are you sorry for?

398
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:26,250
Let's go.

399
00:17:26,510 --> 00:17:28,240
Let's go eat noodles. My treat.

400
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:33,050
I'm definitely getting extra meat
for Comrade Jianmin.

401
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,160
I love meat.

402
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:32,270
What do you think Yin Ping

403
00:18:32,270 --> 00:18:33,130
was doing here?

404
00:18:41,110 --> 00:18:42,030
Stop searching.

405
00:18:42,030 --> 00:18:43,000
You've been searching for so long.

406
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:43,640
You won't find it this way.

407
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:44,510
One last look.

408
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:45,610
Stop searching.

409
00:18:47,240 --> 00:18:48,300
Listen to me, okay?

410
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:50,200
Don't listen to those people's

411
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:50,800
nonsense.

412
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:53,640
Yin Ping's death
has nothing to do with you.

413
00:18:53,750 --> 00:18:54,810
Do you understand?

414
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:55,920
If I were in your position,

415
00:18:55,920 --> 00:18:57,580
I would have released him too.

416
00:18:57,960 --> 00:18:59,220
You did nothing wrong.

417
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,960
Come on, let's go back.

418
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:10,880
Xudong, don't act rashly.

419
00:19:11,790 --> 00:19:13,310
The whole village is looking for you!

420
00:19:13,310 --> 00:19:14,750
You need to go into hiding!

421
00:19:14,750 --> 00:19:15,480
Why should I hide?

422
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:16,310
I didn't do it!

423
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:17,510
I'm not going anywhere!

424
00:19:17,510 --> 00:19:18,710
Keep your voice down.

425
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:19,510
I'm not going anywhere!

426
00:19:19,510 --> 00:19:20,270
I'm staying right here!

427
00:19:20,270 --> 00:19:21,110
Keep your voice down.

428
00:19:21,110 --> 00:19:23,130
You're just bringing trouble
to our family!

429
00:19:23,130 --> 00:19:23,880
Stop arguing, you two.

430
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:25,010
What are you saying?

431
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:26,920
Who are you talking about?

432
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:28,650
Who are you talking about, huh?

433
00:19:29,070 --> 00:19:29,800
Say it again!

434
00:19:33,070 --> 00:19:34,670
Do you suspect Hu Xudong too?

435
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:37,210
I don't suspect anyone.

436
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:38,610
I don't know either.

437
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:41,350
This just shows

438
00:19:41,350 --> 00:19:42,810
how differently we think.

439
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:44,070
The procuratorate and the court

440
00:19:44,070 --> 00:19:45,200
are just different.

441
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:47,400
I'm just worried

442
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:49,070
that everyone thinks it's him.

443
00:19:49,070 --> 00:19:50,400
And the police will too.

444
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,660
But they still need evidence.

445
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:55,240
Such a big case

446
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:56,730
in such a small village.

447
00:19:58,350 --> 00:19:59,440
The higher-ups will definitely demand

448
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:01,160
the case be solved as fast as possible.

449
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:01,760
Being fast

450
00:20:02,110 --> 00:20:03,480
could lead to problems.

451
00:20:09,030 --> 00:20:11,310
I once prosecuted a murder case.

452
00:20:11,830 --> 00:20:13,400
4 hours after the incident,

453
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:14,750
the killer was caught.

454
00:20:14,750 --> 00:20:16,110
His confession matched

455
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,200
all the evidence perfectly.

456
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:19,730
I guarantee
it wasn't a wrongful conviction.

457
00:20:20,510 --> 00:20:21,640
Then if

458
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:23,370
Hu Xudong is really the killer,

459
00:20:23,550 --> 00:20:24,640
doesn't he know he would definitely be

460
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:25,720
the one everyone suspects

461
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:27,310
and definitely couldn't get away?

462
00:20:27,310 --> 00:20:28,770
He's about to get married.

463
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:30,000
Is it worth it

464
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:31,960
to ruin the rest of his life

465
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:33,360
just because of Yin Ping?

466
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:34,440
Yin Ping set fire

467
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:35,700
to his livestock shed.

468
00:20:36,310 --> 00:20:37,350
Anyone else would

469
00:20:37,350 --> 00:20:39,070
have just given Yin a beating.

470
00:20:39,550 --> 00:20:40,310
But he actually

471
00:20:40,310 --> 00:20:42,170
went to court and filed a lawsuit.

472
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:44,770
So now you're telling me

473
00:20:44,790 --> 00:20:46,070
he was so angry

474
00:20:46,070 --> 00:20:47,130
that he killed Yin?

475
00:20:47,350 --> 00:20:48,200
What was the point of all that before?

476
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:50,000
And what's the point of that now?

477
00:20:50,270 --> 00:20:52,110
Does that make any sense?

478
00:20:54,030 --> 00:20:55,310
Sometimes things

479
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:57,320
that don't seem to make sense

480
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:59,750
aren't actually unreasonable.

481
00:20:59,750 --> 00:21:01,640
It's just that information is missing.

482
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:02,790
When you find that piece

483
00:21:02,790 --> 00:21:04,920
of missing information and fill it in,

484
00:21:04,920 --> 00:21:06,580
everything falls into place.

485
00:21:07,480 --> 00:21:09,080
Alright, alright, alright.

486
00:21:09,510 --> 00:21:12,040
You've got sharp logic
and a meticulous mind.

487
00:21:12,350 --> 00:21:13,410
You're the brains,

488
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:14,440
and I'm the brawn.

489
00:21:14,790 --> 00:21:15,480
Happy now?

490
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:20,650
Xia Yingjie.

491
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:25,960
I really enjoy

492
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:27,060
chatting with you.

493
00:21:28,070 --> 00:21:28,880
Maybe I'll just stay here

494
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:29,880
and chat with you.

495
00:21:32,070 --> 00:21:33,830
You're not going back to work on the law?

496
00:21:33,830 --> 00:21:34,920
There are plenty of people doing that.

497
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:35,980
They won't miss me.

498
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:38,070
But I'm the only one

499
00:21:38,200 --> 00:21:39,260
who chats with you.

500
00:21:42,830 --> 00:21:43,790
Those two old men

501
00:21:43,830 --> 00:21:45,290
won't let you off the hook.

502
00:21:45,350 --> 00:21:45,880
And your dad

503
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:47,880
will also come after me with a knife.

504
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,260
It's time to sleep now.

505
00:21:57,790 --> 00:21:59,120
They're arresting him!

506
00:22:00,100 --> 00:22:00,820
Officer!

507
00:22:00,840 --> 00:22:02,110
You've definitely got the wrong person!

508
00:22:02,110 --> 00:22:03,270
How could my brother
possibly kill someone?

509
00:22:03,270 --> 00:22:04,510
Y-You're wronging us!

510
00:22:04,510 --> 00:22:04,960
Wronging us...

511
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:05,510
Yes, I...

512
00:22:05,550 --> 00:22:06,400
You've got the wrong guy!

513
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:07,880
You can't take him away, Officer!

514
00:22:07,880 --> 00:22:09,110
Officer, you can't take him away!

515
00:22:09,110 --> 00:22:09,510
Don't worry.

516
00:22:09,510 --> 00:22:10,200
We're just taking him back

517
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,510
to assist with the investigation.

518
00:22:11,510 --> 00:22:12,310
Don't worry. Don't worry.

519
00:22:12,310 --> 00:22:12,590
Wait...

520
00:22:12,590 --> 00:22:13,310
Xudong!

521
00:22:14,200 --> 00:22:14,720
Xudong!

522
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:15,960
Xudong!

523
00:22:32,070 --> 00:22:33,270
That day, Lin Yan had a fight

524
00:22:33,270 --> 00:22:34,110
with her boyfriend.

525
00:22:34,110 --> 00:22:35,920
She went to Gaoxin Road to make up,

526
00:22:35,920 --> 00:22:36,720
but he didn't show up,

527
00:22:36,720 --> 00:22:38,380
so she went to Shengli Street.

528
00:22:38,750 --> 00:22:40,350
Did Lin Yan live on Shengli Street?

529
00:22:40,350 --> 00:22:40,790
No.

530
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:42,440
It's her boyfriend's place.

531
00:22:42,440 --> 00:22:44,100
She went there to win him back.

532
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:47,680
Why was Lin Yan so keen
on getting him back?

533
00:22:47,680 --> 00:22:49,960
It seems Yan Jicai wasn't lying.

534
00:22:51,070 --> 00:22:52,480
If he hadn't dropped that girl

535
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:53,480
there,

536
00:22:53,830 --> 00:22:56,360
he couldn't have known
about Shengli Street.

537
00:22:57,070 --> 00:22:58,070
Not necessarily.

538
00:22:58,400 --> 00:22:59,030
Maybe they talked about it

539
00:22:59,030 --> 00:23:00,760
while chatting on Gaoxin Road.

540
00:23:01,680 --> 00:23:02,540
Is that likely?

541
00:23:05,270 --> 00:23:06,160
You think every girl

542
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:07,790
is as smart as you?

543
00:23:22,310 --> 00:23:23,160
Coming.

544
00:23:25,240 --> 00:23:25,830
Who is it?

545
00:23:27,170 --> 00:23:27,780
Hello.

546
00:23:28,110 --> 00:23:28,970
You are...

547
00:23:29,040 --> 00:23:30,240
Are you Qiao Xiaojun?

548
00:23:32,550 --> 00:23:34,200
I'm from the municipal procuratorate.

549
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:34,790
We'd like

550
00:23:34,790 --> 00:23:36,250
to ask you a few questions.

551
00:23:37,270 --> 00:23:38,790
What do you need me for?

552
00:23:39,510 --> 00:23:40,480
Do you remember

553
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:42,010
the case involving Lin Yan?

554
00:23:43,550 --> 00:23:44,640
It's been too long.

555
00:23:45,030 --> 00:23:46,230
I've long forgotten.

556
00:23:46,360 --> 00:23:47,120
Anyway,

557
00:23:47,140 --> 00:23:49,140
the victim was your ex-girlfriend.

558
00:23:49,880 --> 00:23:50,880
Before that incident,

559
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:52,280
we had already broken up.

560
00:23:52,510 --> 00:23:54,400
So it means
she had nothing to do with you?

561
00:23:54,400 --> 00:23:54,880
Right?

562
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:57,310
I'm done talking.

563
00:23:58,510 --> 00:23:59,350
I've got things to do.

564
00:23:59,350 --> 00:24:00,210
Please get out.

565
00:24:00,510 --> 00:24:01,110
Leave now.

566
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:03,550
We can leave right now.

567
00:24:03,970 --> 00:24:05,310
But after closing this door,

568
00:24:05,310 --> 00:24:06,970
can you truly forget all this?

569
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:09,200
When you can't sleep at night,

570
00:24:09,640 --> 00:24:10,960
can you face yourself?

571
00:24:12,160 --> 00:24:13,440
I told you to get out!

572
00:24:13,880 --> 00:24:14,880
Do you understand?

573
00:24:14,880 --> 00:24:15,510
Leave now!

574
00:24:17,110 --> 00:24:18,400
A taxi driver

575
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:20,350
was sentenced to death with a reprieve

576
00:24:20,350 --> 00:24:21,720
just for driving her here to see you.

577
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:22,550
He'll likely spend

578
00:24:22,550 --> 00:24:24,070
over 20 years in prison.

579
00:24:24,750 --> 00:24:26,310
He has a wife and child.

580
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:28,860
Do you really feel no guilt at all?

581
00:24:30,510 --> 00:24:32,030
Without finding the real killer,

582
00:24:32,030 --> 00:24:33,560
Lin Yan won't rest in peace.

583
00:24:33,800 --> 00:24:34,830
But you're even unwilling

584
00:24:34,830 --> 00:24:35,830
to tell the truth?

585
00:24:40,790 --> 00:24:42,250
We broke up several times.

586
00:24:43,110 --> 00:24:44,070
The last time,

587
00:24:44,310 --> 00:24:45,350
I was determined.

588
00:24:46,350 --> 00:24:47,550
She was very willful.

589
00:24:48,110 --> 00:24:51,240
She didn't care about anyone else
and always had to have her way.

590
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:53,040
She was exhausting to deal with.

591
00:24:54,400 --> 00:24:55,960
On the night of the incident,

592
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:57,560
she paged me dozens of times.

593
00:24:57,960 --> 00:24:59,690
I didn't respond to any of them.

594
00:25:01,270 --> 00:25:02,270
Do you understand

595
00:25:02,680 --> 00:25:04,210
that suffocating feeling?

596
00:25:09,070 --> 00:25:10,730
What time were the pages made?

597
00:25:14,790 --> 00:25:17,510
The last one was around 9, I think.

598
00:25:18,720 --> 00:25:20,110
She said she was going to wait for me

599
00:25:20,110 --> 00:25:21,640
at our usual spot on Gaoxin Road.

600
00:25:21,640 --> 00:25:22,440
I ignored her,

601
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:24,100
and of course, I didn't go.

602
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:26,130
Later, I got annoyed

603
00:25:26,510 --> 00:25:27,840
and turned off my pager.

604
00:25:29,720 --> 00:25:30,350
Then did you

605
00:25:30,350 --> 00:25:32,410
get any missed messages the next day?

606
00:25:36,030 --> 00:25:37,490
I was in a bad mood that day.

607
00:25:37,720 --> 00:25:38,790
I went out drinking with friends,

608
00:25:38,790 --> 00:25:40,240
didn't get back until after midnight,

609
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:42,240
and fell asleep as soon as I got home.

610
00:25:43,510 --> 00:25:45,110
The police suspected me too.

611
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:46,750
They asked me a lot of questions,

612
00:25:46,750 --> 00:25:47,880
but I had an alibi.

613
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:49,830
Yan Jicai said

614
00:25:49,830 --> 00:25:51,310
the last place Lin Yan got off

615
00:25:51,310 --> 00:25:52,310
was on Shengli Street,

616
00:25:52,310 --> 00:25:53,770
right outside your place.

617
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:55,580
Didn't she knock on your door?

618
00:25:56,440 --> 00:25:57,570
I was drunk that day.

619
00:25:57,750 --> 00:26:00,480
Even if she had knocked,
I wouldn't have heard it.

620
00:26:02,110 --> 00:26:03,680
Have you ever met Yan Jicai?

621
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,160
I saw him in court.

622
00:26:07,590 --> 00:26:08,550
Do you think

623
00:26:09,590 --> 00:26:11,590
he killed your ex-girlfriend?

624
00:26:21,880 --> 00:26:22,940
I trust the police.

625
00:26:26,270 --> 00:26:27,160
Okay, okay.

626
00:26:29,480 --> 00:26:30,350
What a crowd.

627
00:26:30,590 --> 00:26:31,000
Honey.

628
00:26:31,960 --> 00:26:34,020
Xiaojun, are these your colleagues?

629
00:26:34,240 --> 00:26:35,270
Thank you.

630
00:26:36,510 --> 00:26:38,840
For this Patriotic Sanitation Campaign,

631
00:26:38,930 --> 00:26:40,790
our street committee is determined

632
00:26:40,790 --> 00:26:42,200
to win the red banner.

633
00:26:43,160 --> 00:26:43,760
Of course,

634
00:26:43,920 --> 00:26:46,520
we still need the support
of all the neighbors.

635
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:47,550
We will definitely support it.

636
00:26:47,550 --> 00:26:48,510
-Okay, okay.
-We will definitely support it.

637
00:26:48,510 --> 00:26:50,110
Alright, alright. Goodbye.

638
00:26:51,830 --> 00:26:52,720
Your child is back.

639
00:26:52,720 --> 00:26:53,880
So pretty.

640
00:26:54,640 --> 00:26:55,750
Bye.

641
00:26:56,140 --> 00:26:57,140
Bye.

642
00:26:57,830 --> 00:26:59,270
Look, is the doll pretty?

643
00:26:59,680 --> 00:27:00,410
Is it pretty?

644
00:27:07,720 --> 00:27:08,270
Mentor.

645
00:27:08,310 --> 00:27:09,050
I don't think Qiao Xiaojun

646
00:27:09,050 --> 00:27:10,090
told us the truth.

647
00:27:10,590 --> 00:27:11,920
I have the same feeling.

648
00:27:12,070 --> 00:27:12,790
Me too.

649
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:15,380
Why would he hold things back?

650
00:27:15,510 --> 00:27:16,160
That's what we

651
00:27:16,160 --> 00:27:17,270
need to figure out.

652
00:27:17,510 --> 00:27:19,170
We'll come here another time.

653
00:27:19,240 --> 00:27:20,240
We have to go back.

654
00:27:21,200 --> 00:27:22,480
Otherwise, the procuratorate

655
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:24,810
will definitely discipline the two of us.

656
00:27:37,830 --> 00:27:38,640
What...

657
00:27:38,750 --> 00:27:39,830
are you doing?

658
00:27:42,200 --> 00:27:43,590
Keeping you safe. Look.

659
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:46,400
You're out of your mind.

660
00:27:49,110 --> 00:27:50,910
Now that this door is installed,

661
00:27:51,270 --> 00:27:53,480
I'll be able to rest easy
when I'm back in Beijing.

662
00:27:53,480 --> 00:27:54,540
You're going back?

663
00:27:55,240 --> 00:27:56,000
I have to.

664
00:27:56,160 --> 00:27:57,160
If I don't go back,

665
00:27:57,240 --> 00:27:58,830
those two old men will come after me.

666
00:27:58,830 --> 00:27:59,890
Will you come back?

667
00:28:03,310 --> 00:28:04,910
I'll come back if you need me.

668
00:28:10,680 --> 00:28:12,160
The village just posted a notice

669
00:28:12,160 --> 00:28:13,420
to look for witnesses.

670
00:28:13,880 --> 00:28:14,940
Just like you said,

671
00:28:15,550 --> 00:28:17,070
it's really hard to pinpoint

672
00:28:17,070 --> 00:28:18,400
the exact time of death.

673
00:28:20,510 --> 00:28:21,200
I saw it.

674
00:28:21,770 --> 00:28:22,610
It's probably

675
00:28:22,640 --> 00:28:24,240
because Hu Xudong has an alibi.

676
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:25,960
They ran into problems
during the interrogation.

677
00:28:25,960 --> 00:28:27,490
Then he should be ruled out.

678
00:28:28,000 --> 00:28:28,590
If you were the police,

679
00:28:28,590 --> 00:28:29,720
would you let him go?

680
00:28:32,590 --> 00:28:34,190
There is other evidence too.

681
00:28:34,350 --> 00:28:35,310
I understand.

682
00:28:37,200 --> 00:28:39,530
Since the police have their sights on him,

683
00:28:40,110 --> 00:28:42,270
it is hard for Hu Xudong
to clear his name,

684
00:28:42,270 --> 00:28:42,790
unless there is

685
00:28:42,790 --> 00:28:44,030
exceptionally strong evidence

686
00:28:44,030 --> 00:28:45,160
proving he had absolutely no chance

687
00:28:45,160 --> 00:28:46,560
of committing the crime.

688
00:28:46,960 --> 00:28:48,200
For example,

689
00:28:48,960 --> 00:28:50,920
he wasn't in the village that night,

690
00:28:50,920 --> 00:28:51,590
but in town,

691
00:28:52,110 --> 00:28:54,040
and he needs a witness to back it up.

692
00:28:55,510 --> 00:28:57,310
The hardest part right now is

693
00:28:57,960 --> 00:28:59,880
that they can neither confirm his guilt

694
00:28:59,880 --> 00:29:01,110
nor rule him out.

695
00:29:01,570 --> 00:29:02,880
And you know the usual practice

696
00:29:02,880 --> 00:29:04,010
in such situations.

697
00:29:05,310 --> 00:29:06,030
That is precisely why we are

698
00:29:06,030 --> 00:29:07,030
revising the law.

699
00:29:09,750 --> 00:29:10,480
If this case

700
00:29:10,480 --> 00:29:11,720
proceeds to prosecution,

701
00:29:11,720 --> 00:29:13,880
it will definitely fall
under the Binjiang Procuratorate.

702
00:29:13,880 --> 00:29:14,790
The key is

703
00:29:14,830 --> 00:29:16,430
who the chief prosecutor is.

704
00:29:16,790 --> 00:29:20,120
It also depends on the attitude
of your Intermediate Court.

705
00:29:21,270 --> 00:29:22,480
How did we end up talking

706
00:29:22,480 --> 00:29:23,330
as if this has already become

707
00:29:23,330 --> 00:29:24,660
a wrongful conviction?

708
00:29:26,350 --> 00:29:27,480
Let's hope it's not.

709
00:29:34,310 --> 00:29:35,640
It's been so many years.

710
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:37,000
The case was closed long ago.

711
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:37,720
All the materials

712
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:39,200
have been transferred
to the procuratorate.

713
00:29:39,200 --> 00:29:39,880
How about

714
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:41,830
you go to the procuratorate
and take a look?

715
00:29:41,830 --> 00:29:42,790
From what I know,

716
00:29:43,310 --> 00:29:44,750
the police keep internal

717
00:29:44,790 --> 00:29:46,550
investigation supplementary files.

718
00:29:46,550 --> 00:29:47,790
Those files don't have to be transferred

719
00:29:47,790 --> 00:29:49,050
to the procuratorate.

720
00:29:49,070 --> 00:29:49,640
Well,

721
00:29:50,070 --> 00:29:52,670
could we take a look
at the supplementary file?

722
00:29:54,720 --> 00:29:56,160
What investigation supplementary files?

723
00:29:56,160 --> 00:29:56,590
Wang.

724
00:29:58,030 --> 00:29:58,830
Wait a moment.

725
00:30:09,960 --> 00:30:10,510
Let's go.

726
00:30:21,790 --> 00:30:22,920
So our last stop

727
00:30:22,960 --> 00:30:24,690
is Liangcheng Law Firm, right?

728
00:30:24,960 --> 00:30:25,690
No need to go.

729
00:30:26,400 --> 00:30:27,030
Why?

730
00:30:27,350 --> 00:30:28,480
I called yesterday.

731
00:30:28,830 --> 00:30:29,790
Mr. Zhou is on a business trip.

732
00:30:29,790 --> 00:30:31,250
He won't be back for a week.

733
00:30:34,110 --> 00:30:34,910
Then, Mr. Guo,

734
00:30:35,160 --> 00:30:36,590
I'll head back to the office
to handle some things first.

735
00:30:36,590 --> 00:30:37,750
I'll come see you off tomorrow.

736
00:30:37,750 --> 00:30:38,720
No need. No need.

737
00:30:38,740 --> 00:30:39,270
Jianmin.

738
00:30:39,640 --> 00:30:40,680
We've already troubled you enough.

739
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:41,680
It's no trouble at all.

740
00:30:41,680 --> 00:30:42,270
I insist.

741
00:30:43,720 --> 00:30:44,400
Take care.

742
00:30:44,420 --> 00:30:45,420
Alright, see you.

743
00:30:46,310 --> 00:30:46,830
See you.

744
00:30:51,400 --> 00:30:52,070
Mentor,

745
00:30:52,350 --> 00:30:54,280
we didn't get much out of this trip.

746
00:30:54,830 --> 00:30:55,890
Who said we didn't?

747
00:30:55,900 --> 00:31:00,670
[Nanlu Public Security Bureau]

748
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:58,400
We got a lot out of it.

749
00:30:59,590 --> 00:31:00,960
I'm really happy for you.

750
00:31:00,960 --> 00:31:02,290
Happy for me about what?

751
00:31:03,880 --> 00:31:05,590
You head back to the hotel first.

752
00:31:05,590 --> 00:31:07,070
I've got something to take care of.

753
00:31:07,070 --> 00:31:07,790
Y-You take this

754
00:31:07,790 --> 00:31:08,550
back for me.

755
00:31:08,790 --> 00:31:09,590
By yourself?

756
00:31:12,160 --> 00:31:13,290
Personal business.

757
00:31:14,270 --> 00:31:15,800
Nothing to do with the case.

758
00:31:17,200 --> 00:31:18,730
Be careful on your way back.

759
00:31:36,310 --> 00:31:36,840
Jianmin.

760
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:37,510
Mr. Guo.

761
00:31:38,790 --> 00:31:39,390
What's up?

762
00:31:39,680 --> 00:31:41,030
Let me treat you to a meal.

763
00:31:41,030 --> 00:31:41,400
Okay.

764
00:31:41,480 --> 00:31:41,810
Okay.

765
00:31:42,160 --> 00:31:42,690
Let's go.

766
00:31:55,720 --> 00:31:56,270
Mr. Guo.

767
00:31:57,070 --> 00:31:57,880
Today you...

768
00:31:58,200 --> 00:31:59,730
Come on, let's drink first.

769
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:03,400
Drink up.

770
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:16,730
I'll just ask one thing.

771
00:32:18,790 --> 00:32:19,920
Answer me honestly.

772
00:32:21,790 --> 00:32:22,640
Go ahead.

773
00:32:23,290 --> 00:32:24,160
Do you have feelings

774
00:32:24,160 --> 00:32:25,000
for Lihui?

775
00:32:27,510 --> 00:32:30,070
Mr. Guo,
why are you asking this all of a sudden?

776
00:32:30,070 --> 00:32:31,030
If you do, just say so.

777
00:32:31,030 --> 00:32:32,360
If not, that's fine too.

778
00:32:33,240 --> 00:32:34,070
Lihui

779
00:32:34,640 --> 00:32:36,590
might not even like you.

780
00:32:37,500 --> 00:32:38,640
I'm just worried unnecessary

781
00:32:38,640 --> 00:32:40,500
misunderstandings might arise.

782
00:32:48,030 --> 00:32:49,290
You're right, Mr. Guo.

783
00:32:49,790 --> 00:32:50,990
I do like Zhang Lihui.

784
00:32:51,200 --> 00:32:52,330
I like her very much.

785
00:32:52,480 --> 00:32:53,480
I've liked her for over a decade.

786
00:32:53,480 --> 00:32:55,140
I've liked her for a long time.

787
00:32:55,720 --> 00:32:56,550
Good for you.

788
00:32:58,790 --> 00:32:59,240
Go on.

789
00:33:00,590 --> 00:33:01,350
That's all.

790
00:33:07,680 --> 00:33:08,920
I got it.

791
00:33:11,640 --> 00:33:12,200
Boss.

792
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:13,740
Check, please.

793
00:33:15,480 --> 00:33:15,940
Coming.

794
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:17,040
No, no.

795
00:33:17,070 --> 00:33:18,000
Wait a minute.

796
00:33:18,750 --> 00:33:19,160
What?

797
00:33:19,560 --> 00:33:21,080
Mr. Guo, you've got it,

798
00:33:21,110 --> 00:33:22,550
but I haven't got a clue.

799
00:33:23,030 --> 00:33:24,560
What about Lihui? I mean...

800
00:33:24,830 --> 00:33:26,030
You want to know

801
00:33:26,270 --> 00:33:27,960
if Lihui likes you too?

802
00:33:32,880 --> 00:33:35,030
She hasn't told me either.

803
00:33:36,200 --> 00:33:38,070
Don't you have a feeling about it?

804
00:33:41,720 --> 00:33:43,680
I've never dared to have a feeling.

805
00:33:44,400 --> 00:33:46,000
Then go after her!

806
00:33:46,030 --> 00:33:48,270
Show her how you feel.
Show her your devotion.

807
00:33:48,270 --> 00:33:50,000
You're a grown man.

808
00:33:50,240 --> 00:33:51,960
Are you going to let a girl

809
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:53,900
show her feelings and devotion to you

810
00:33:53,900 --> 00:33:55,160
and chase you instead?

811
00:33:57,640 --> 00:33:58,790
Come on.

812
00:34:01,320 --> 00:34:02,590
To be honest, Mr. Guo,

813
00:34:03,400 --> 00:34:05,310
I actually feel a bit inferior.

814
00:34:07,070 --> 00:34:08,880
She's from the Supreme Procuratorate

815
00:34:08,880 --> 00:34:10,139
and holds a doctorate.

816
00:34:11,110 --> 00:34:12,840
I'm just a demobilized soldier

817
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:14,070
who got into this field halfway.

818
00:34:14,070 --> 00:34:15,110
I'm also a demobilized soldier

819
00:34:15,110 --> 00:34:16,360
who got into this field halfway,

820
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:18,159
but she's still my goddaughter.

821
00:34:18,520 --> 00:34:18,980
Mr. Guo,

822
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:20,280
that's not what I meant.

823
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:22,409
Are you that afraid of being rejected?

824
00:34:22,800 --> 00:34:25,030
How precious do you think your pride is?

825
00:34:25,150 --> 00:34:27,630
You keep saying you like her,

826
00:34:28,710 --> 00:34:31,040
but it seems you care more about yourself.

827
00:34:35,400 --> 00:34:36,480
You're right to criticize me.

828
00:34:36,480 --> 00:34:37,800
No matter how valid my criticism is

829
00:34:37,800 --> 00:34:39,929
and how deeply your understanding is,

830
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:41,230
if you don't take action,

831
00:34:41,230 --> 00:34:42,360
it's all empty talk!

832
00:34:47,480 --> 00:34:48,280
Jianmin.

833
00:34:49,230 --> 00:34:50,000
You know,

834
00:34:51,440 --> 00:34:52,880
you're a good young man.

835
00:34:54,110 --> 00:34:55,909
Don't underestimate yourself.

836
00:34:56,840 --> 00:34:58,640
And don't underestimate Lihui.

837
00:34:59,360 --> 00:35:00,760
She's not that snobbish.

838
00:35:00,920 --> 00:35:02,550
This is all I can do for you.

839
00:35:02,590 --> 00:35:04,650
You should know what to do now, right?

840
00:35:09,360 --> 00:35:09,960
By the way,

841
00:35:10,840 --> 00:35:12,510
we only talked about the case today.

842
00:35:12,510 --> 00:35:13,760
We didn't talk about any of this.

843
00:35:13,760 --> 00:35:14,440
Got it?

844
00:35:17,320 --> 00:35:18,880
You're paying for this meal.

845
00:35:18,880 --> 00:35:19,410
I'll pay.

846
00:35:22,110 --> 00:35:22,760
Mr. Guo.

847
00:35:23,440 --> 00:35:24,840
I like chatting with you.

848
00:35:25,280 --> 00:35:26,340
It's really great!

849
00:35:26,840 --> 00:35:27,400
Really?

850
00:35:32,030 --> 00:35:32,490
Come on.

851
00:35:32,750 --> 00:35:33,550
Finish this!

852
00:35:33,840 --> 00:35:34,190
Okay.

853
00:35:41,030 --> 00:35:41,510
Lihui.

854
00:35:42,620 --> 00:35:44,280
Mentor, the door is unlocked.

855
00:35:45,280 --> 00:35:46,510
I'm here to get my cup.

856
00:35:50,670 --> 00:35:52,600
Where did you go? You look so happy.

857
00:35:54,000 --> 00:35:54,920
Thank you, Mentor.

858
00:35:54,920 --> 00:35:55,920
Have you finished the materials?

859
00:35:55,920 --> 00:35:56,480
Yes.

860
00:35:57,850 --> 00:35:59,410
I'm planning to find

861
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:00,480
a print shop nearby tomorrow

862
00:36:00,480 --> 00:36:01,940
and print all of these out.

863
00:36:02,280 --> 00:36:03,570
Then I'll send copies
to the local procuratorate,

864
00:36:03,570 --> 00:36:04,710
court and public security bureau

865
00:36:04,710 --> 00:36:05,800
respectively.

866
00:36:06,840 --> 00:36:07,240
Don't.

867
00:36:08,760 --> 00:36:10,760
Let's talk about it when we get back.

868
00:36:11,150 --> 00:36:11,800
Why?

869
00:36:12,480 --> 00:36:13,340
Think about it.

870
00:36:13,960 --> 00:36:15,150
This case caused

871
00:36:15,280 --> 00:36:16,480
a huge stir back then.

872
00:36:17,190 --> 00:36:19,150
Print shops are crowded with people.

873
00:36:19,150 --> 00:36:20,760
If word gets out,

874
00:36:21,800 --> 00:36:22,800
would that help resolve the matter

875
00:36:22,800 --> 00:36:24,000
or make it worse?

876
00:36:25,590 --> 00:36:26,850
You're right, Mentor.

877
00:36:27,630 --> 00:36:29,560
You are indeed cunning and crafty.

878
00:36:34,400 --> 00:36:35,670
Show some respect.

879
00:36:35,840 --> 00:36:37,000
I'm just afraid that once we leave,

880
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:38,590
this case will be buried.

881
00:36:39,320 --> 00:36:39,850
It won't.

882
00:36:39,880 --> 00:36:40,880
I've entrusted it

883
00:36:41,840 --> 00:36:42,880
to Zheng Jianmin

884
00:36:43,400 --> 00:36:45,400
and asked him to keep an eye on it for us.

885
00:36:45,400 --> 00:36:47,330
You entrusted it to Zheng Jianmin?

886
00:36:49,440 --> 00:36:50,800
He works for the procuratorate.

887
00:36:50,800 --> 00:36:52,230
You're planting

888
00:36:52,550 --> 00:36:53,750
an undercover agent.

889
00:36:54,150 --> 00:36:55,280
Is he willing to do it?

890
00:36:55,280 --> 00:36:56,150
He's willing.

891
00:36:57,880 --> 00:36:59,340
Definitely very willing.

892
00:37:02,960 --> 00:37:04,090
Get some rest early.

893
00:37:23,130 --> 00:37:24,930
Why are they burying him so soon?

894
00:37:27,360 --> 00:37:28,550
Chinese people believe

895
00:37:28,550 --> 00:37:30,880
that burial brings peace to the deceased.

896
00:37:33,030 --> 00:37:34,430
His grandma had no money.

897
00:37:34,630 --> 00:37:35,830
The funeral expenses

898
00:37:36,360 --> 00:37:38,510
were covered by everyone's contributions.

899
00:37:38,510 --> 00:37:40,040
The village chipped in too.

900
00:37:58,190 --> 00:38:00,590
You're the one who let my grandson out?

901
00:38:03,480 --> 00:38:04,110
Ma'am,

902
00:38:04,550 --> 00:38:06,510
you've got the wrong person. Not her.

903
00:38:06,510 --> 00:38:07,110
I'm sorry.

904
00:38:07,880 --> 00:38:08,320
Ma'am.

905
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:12,650
It was me who let him out.

906
00:38:16,760 --> 00:38:18,440
This child had a hard life.

907
00:38:20,400 --> 00:38:22,760
He lost his parents when he was little.

908
00:38:23,810 --> 00:38:25,230
Sometimes he was confused,

909
00:38:25,230 --> 00:38:27,230
and sometimes he was clear-headed.

910
00:38:27,230 --> 00:38:29,360
He was bullied all day long.

911
00:38:32,750 --> 00:38:34,150
It's good that he's gone.

912
00:38:35,920 --> 00:38:37,440
He's in a better place now.

913
00:38:38,480 --> 00:38:39,230
Thank you.

914
00:38:40,110 --> 00:38:42,400
Thank you for helping him

915
00:38:44,150 --> 00:38:46,710
and our family!

916
00:38:46,730 --> 00:38:47,340
Ma'am!

917
00:38:47,480 --> 00:38:48,190
Ma'am, come on.

918
00:38:48,190 --> 00:38:48,800
Alright, alright.

919
00:38:48,800 --> 00:38:49,600
Get up. Get up.

920
00:38:49,760 --> 00:38:50,840
Get up. Let's go.

921
00:38:51,630 --> 00:38:52,590
Alright, alright.

922
00:38:52,590 --> 00:38:53,520
Alright, Ma'am.

923
00:38:59,800 --> 00:39:03,030
Hu family!

924
00:39:04,000 --> 00:39:08,510
Thank you for raising a murderer

925
00:39:09,100 --> 00:39:11,780
who killed my grandson!

926
00:39:12,530 --> 00:39:14,850
I thank your whole family!

927
00:39:14,880 --> 00:39:16,230
Alright, Ma'am. Alright.

928
00:39:16,230 --> 00:39:17,150
Alright, alright.

929
00:39:17,150 --> 00:39:17,920
Alright, alright.

930
00:39:17,920 --> 00:39:21,760
I really thank your family!

931
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:24,920
You raised a murderer!

932
00:39:25,030 --> 00:39:25,960
Alright, Ma'am.

933
00:39:26,880 --> 00:39:28,080
Don't cry. Don't cry.

934
00:39:32,360 --> 00:39:33,890
Alright, don't cry, Ma'am.

935
00:39:59,620 --> 00:40:00,500
Dear passengers...

936
00:40:00,120 --> 00:40:03,420
[Nanlu Station]

937
00:40:01,320 --> 00:40:02,580
When can we meet again?

938
00:40:03,520 --> 00:40:05,230
I think we'll meet again soon.

939
00:40:06,800 --> 00:40:07,960
I'm already craving the rice noodles

940
00:40:07,960 --> 00:40:08,960
you treated me to.

941
00:40:09,280 --> 00:40:10,480
I want some right now.

942
00:40:11,290 --> 00:40:12,150
Then I'll tell the driver
to delay departure.

943
00:40:12,150 --> 00:40:13,810
I'll go get you some right now.

944
00:40:19,440 --> 00:40:20,900
Thank you, Zheng Jianmin.

945
00:40:21,360 --> 00:40:23,090
I'm really happy I got to see you

946
00:40:23,280 --> 00:40:24,110
this time.

947
00:40:24,760 --> 00:40:25,280
Me too.

948
00:40:27,550 --> 00:40:28,080
Goodbye.

949
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:30,330
Goodbye.

950
00:40:32,400 --> 00:40:32,860
Well...

951
00:40:39,230 --> 00:40:40,360
You should go now.

952
00:40:42,590 --> 00:40:44,050
Let me help you carry it up.

953
00:40:44,280 --> 00:40:44,740
No need.

954
00:40:44,760 --> 00:40:45,960
I'll watch you leave.

955
00:40:47,440 --> 00:40:48,900
You get on the train first.

956
00:40:49,800 --> 00:40:50,400
You go.

957
00:40:52,190 --> 00:40:53,720
I'll watch you leave first.

958
00:40:58,150 --> 00:40:58,680
Goodbye.

959
00:40:59,840 --> 00:41:00,370
Goodbye.

960
00:41:01,510 --> 00:41:02,040
Goodbye.

961
00:41:03,360 --> 00:41:04,160
Safe travels.

962
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:07,530
Goodbye.

963
00:41:27,880 --> 00:41:28,550
Lihui.

964
00:41:30,630 --> 00:41:31,670
I feel

965
