you're about to say goodbye to Bieshan.

966
00:41:37,110 --> 00:41:38,770
And it's about time to do that.

967
00:41:49,230 --> 00:41:50,160
Don't see me off.

968
00:41:50,510 --> 00:41:51,510
You go back first.

969
00:41:53,960 --> 00:41:54,960
Don't put too much

970
00:41:55,440 --> 00:41:56,700
