974
00:42:03,440 --> 00:42:04,640
I'll come over again.

975
00:42:04,710 --> 00:42:05,150
Don't.

976
00:42:05,840 --> 00:42:06,300
No need.

977
00:42:10,070 --> 00:42:10,630
Okay.

978
00:42:11,320 --> 00:42:12,920
Call me if you need anything.

979
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:14,200
I'll come right away.

980
00:42:14,230 --> 00:42:14,760
Yizhong.

981
00:42:18,280 --> 00:42:18,880
I'm sorry.

982
00:42:21,000 --> 00:42:21,480
