986
00:42:30,180 --> 00:42:32,580
Maybe it's because I've seen my mentor,

987
00:42:33,320 --> 00:42:34,920
Qiu Agui, Qian Xingliang,

988
00:42:35,670 --> 00:42:36,480
and so many

989
00:42:36,510 --> 00:42:37,570
